OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Flargely dry this evening across the
OL,7,Fsouth, but outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fcontinuing elsewhere. Rain then
OL,9,Fbecoming increasingly heavy and more
OL,10,Fwidespread after midnight. Much milder
OL,11,Fthan last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA rather cloudy and wet
OL,14,Fday, with the rain heaviest and most
OL,15,Fpersistent in Lancashire and Cumbria.
OL,16,FBreezy in the south. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage, but feeling cool in prolonged
OL,18,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
